Jazz Funk Greats abre la puerta al industrial bailable y al synth-pop), Cabaret Voltaire, Clock DVA. Con los sellos independientes, la diversificación: Nurse With Wound, Zoviet France, This Heat, 23 Skidoo, Current 93 (y su folk apocalíptico), Hafler Trio, Coil, Psychic TV, Test Dept, Lustmord. Desde Australia, Foetus, el primer compositor «clásico» de la civilización punk (Hole, Nail, Thaw). En EE UU, Arcane Device y Controlled Bleeding.","color":"#94a3b8","family":"Gótico e industrial","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial"}],"book_tracks":[{"id":18487334071715,"artist":"Controlled Bleeding","artist_id":221211280361314,"title":"Knees And Bones","year":1985,"ess":0,"yt":"kVwNamnGX-k","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Música industrial","scene_id":145647343892302,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial","chapters":["Sección 5.8"],"pages":[[1,142,null]]},{"id":12299394402375,"artist":"Controlled Bleeding","artist_id":221211280361314,"title":"Headcrack","year":1986,"ess":0,"yt":"AmkjloGMgP0","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Música industrial","scene_id":145647343892302,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial","chapters":["Sección 5.8"],"pages":[[1,142,null]]},{"id":34964880754587,"artist":"Controlled Bleeding","artist_id":221211280361314,"title":"Between Tides","year":1986,"ess":0,"yt":"1EKwqyn018c","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Música industrial","scene_id":145647343892302,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial","chapters":["Sección 5.8"],"pages":[[1,142,null]]},{"id":30383779900458,"artist":"Controlled Bleeding","artist_id":221211280361314,"title":"Trudge","year":1990,"ess":0,"yt":"05vVJP6mW80","kind":"a","book":{"id":8,"title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","url":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/"},"scene":"Música industrial","scene_id":145647343892302,"scene_link":"https://volteret4.github.io/scaruffi/#industrial","chapters":["Sección 5.8"],"pages":[[1,142,null]]}],"mentions":[{"book":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000","author":"Piero Scaruffi","page":142,"text":"…ten-years old new-wave. David Lee Meyers' Arcane Device (1) bordered on electronic avantgarde on works such as Engines Of Myth (1988). Paul Lemos' Controlled Bleeding (1) began in a primitive/industrial vein with Knees And Bones (1985): visceral cacophony, walls of metallic percussions, devastating feedback,…"}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Promoters of Industrial Imagery","body":"Controlled Bleeding was mentioned as one of the groups that actively promoted the industrial imagery and feel through their music, contributing to the broader industrial scene. \"This industrial imagery and feel was also being promoted by a number of other groups, groups with names like SPK, Nurse with Wound, D-A-F, controlled bleeding, and wire.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"The Post-Punk Explosion Part 3: Industrial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zSFhhEaiYwE"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Promoters of Industrial Imagery","body":"Nurse with Wound was identified as a group that promoted the industrial imagery and feel within their music, alongside other acts contributing to the emerging industrial sound. \"This industrial imagery and feel was also being promoted by a number of other groups, groups with names like SPK, Nurse with Wound, D-A-F, controlled bleeding, and wire.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Nurse With Wound","from_id":267001510629900,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing Histo